{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2018-biology-04","exam":"MDEET","year":2018,"subject":"biology","number":4,"points":3,"unitId":"endocrine","unitLabel":"내분비","topic":"호르몬·갑상샘·갑상샘자극","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["endocrine","immune","signaling"],"stem":"그레브스병(Graves’ disease)은 갑상샘자극호르몬 수용체에 대한 \n항체(항-TSHR 항체)에 의해 유발된다. 그림은 그레브스병을 앓고 \n있는 임산부로부터 항-TSHR 항체가 태아에게 전달되는 것을 \n나타낸 것이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n[3점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 태아로 전달되는 항-TSHR 항체는 IgA 형이다.\nㄴ. 임산부에서 갑상샘호르몬은 갑상샘자극호르몬 분비를 억제한다.\nㄷ. 임산부에서 항-TSHR 항체는 갑상샘호르몬 분비를 증가시킨다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]}],"answer":4,"acceptedAnswers":[4],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":503,"height":289,"region":0,"bbox":[69.48,84.723,201.2,115.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2018-biology-04/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":190,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,272.723,310.4,76.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t007","t008","t009","t010"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2018-biology-04/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":2,"sourceRect":[430.12,687.677,759.1,1067.602],"width":328.98,"height":379.925,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[69.48,84.723,201.2,115.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.28,272.723,310.4,76.0],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"4. 그레브스병(Graves’ disease)은 갑상샘자극호르몬 수용체에 대한 ","bbox":[5.0,5.0,323.081,12.276],"spans":[{"text":"4.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,10.0,12.276],"origin":[5.0,14.024],"size":11.696,"flags":4,"font":"*Ç